# Lessons promoted to rules

- Requirements: no adjective without a number. "Fast" is not a requirement; "p95 < 300 ms at 50 rps" is.
- Build plans: a slice that touches only one layer is horizontal. Re-cut it.
- Tests: a test that passes on first run proves nothing. Record the red run.
- Reviews: review in a fresh context. The implementer is in the dumb zone by the time it finishes.
